      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> 1/day.</p>\n<p>The Chelaxian adjutant shouts at all present. The adjutant makes an intimidation|defense:will check and compares it to the Will DCs of all enemies within 30 feet. On a success, that foe is Frightened 1. A critical success does not grant an additional effect.</p>",
